{"id": 10008320, "reference": "A12/00670/23", "publication_date": "2023-03-30T15:43:27.909Z", "modification_date": "2023-03-30T15:53:16.549Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "CHEMICAL_PRODUCTS", "product_name": "Tattoo ink", "product_name_specific": "Dark Brown Tattoo Ink", "risk_description": "The product contains naphthalene and has an excessive concentration of benzo[a]pyrene, arsenic, antimony, cobalt, lead and nickel (measured values: 0.000077%, <0.000018%, 0.00081%, 0.00013%, 0.00092%, 0.00034%, 0.0060% by weight, respectively).\nNaphthalene may irritate the skin and might cause cancer. \nBenzo[a]pyrene is a polycyclic-aromatic hydrocarbon (PAH), which may cause cancer and is also mutagenic and toxic for reproduction. \nArsenic may cause cancer, may damage fertility or the unborn child, causes damage to organs through prolonged or repeated exposure.\nAntimony can irritate the skin. Cobalt is a skin sensitiser and may cause cancer. Lead is harmful to human health, accumulates in the body and may affect breast-fed or unborn children. Nickel can cause skin irritation, induce sensitisation or elicit allergic responses.", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the REACH Regulation.", "country_of_origin": "United Kingdom", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Dimension"], "model_types": [], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL"], "measures": ["BAN_MARKETING_OF_PRODUCT"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10076282, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10076283, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10076284, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}